{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想擺脫每晚苦惱「今晚吃甚麼」的循環，Meal Planner &amp; Menu 以固定流程把整週菜單一次規劃完成，由菜式收藏、買菜清單到剩菜安排都自動處理，適閤家庭煮夫煮婦、獨居上班族及經常加班外食的人。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-165.webp\">\n<h2>四步規劃法建立每週菜單</h2>\n<p>7Mealz Meal Planner 採用四步規劃法：先建立 10 至 15 道常煮菜式，再挑出 3 至 5 道 15 分鐘內完成的簡易菜，然後描述每晚的精力狀態，最後定下固定的計劃日。每週規劃時，每天只顯示符合當日難度的菜式，也可一鍵自動排好整週菜單；標記「多做一份」後，翌日自動列為剩菜日，買菜清單同時加倍份量並可匯出 PDF。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-47-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-48-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-49-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-50-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-51-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-52-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Meal Planner &amp; Menu – 7mealz</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:19:39.655744+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:02:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T12:58:14.594573+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:17:41.692740+00:00","content_hash":"906dc69dc728149210756f4205fece8e2a92d4514af515983a904478c3411a16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}